DATA USAGE NOTICE:

This repository contains code for analyzing data from the Millennium Cohort
Study (MCS). The MCS data are subject to separate licensing and data sharing
restrictions. Access to MCS data requires registration with the UK Data Service
and acceptance of their terms and conditions.

The code in this repository is openly available under the MIT License, but the
data files are NOT included and must be obtained separately through proper
channels. Researchers using this code must:

1. Obtain independent access to MCS data through the UK Data Service
2. Comply with all MCS data usage agreements
3. Not share or redistribute raw or processed MCS data files
4. Cite the MCS data appropriately in any publications

For data access information, visit: https://ukdataservice.ac.uk/
